\subtree{
  \title{Decision}
  \ol{
    \li{A human freezes definitions for a milestone (→ \ref{rm-0000}) by marking decisions \code{frozen} and stating the acceptance tests in Lean (\code{sorry} bodies are fine; statements are not).}
    \li{Agents pick \code{stated} acceptance tests and \code{sorry} nodes, in dependency order, preferring nodes that unblock the most dependents.}
    \li{A PR must: cite decisions; add no new sealed constants without a decision; keep the swap test green; regenerate the human layer; leave the forest buildable.}
    \li{Definitions are not agent-editable in \code{frozen} areas; in \code{provisional} areas amendments go through → \ref{dec-tl-0001}.}
    \li{Nightly: kernel-backed full build (→ D-RT-13 (5)), forest rebuild and publish, benchmark nodes.}
  }
}
\subtree{
